      <body>
         <pb facs="loc_ew.00029.jpg" xml:id="leaf001r" type="recto"/>
         <lg type="poem">
            <head type="main" rend="underline">A North Star <gap reason="torn away"/> South</head>
            
            <l>Welcome <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a001">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a001">Brazilian</add> brother—thy <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a002">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a002">ample</add> place is ready;</l>
            <l><del rend="overstrike">A shouting cheer to thee from the north</del></l>
            <l>A <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">ready</del> <add place="above" seq="2">loving</add></subst> hand—a smile <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a003">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a003">from the north&#8212;</add>—a sunny <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a004">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a004">instant</add> Hail!</l>
            <l>(Let the future <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">look</del> <add place="above" seq="2">care</add></subst> for itself where it <subst><add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a005">&#8248;</metamark> </add><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">uses</del> <add place="above" seq="2" xml:id="a005">reveals its</add></subst><lb/> troubles, impedimentas</l>
            <l>Be <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a006">&#8248;</metamark></add><del rend="overstrike"><add place="above" xml:id="a006">always</add></del> ours the present throe, the <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a007">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a007">democratic</add> aim, the <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a008">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a008">acceptance and the</add> faith)</l>
            <l><del rend="overstrike"><add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a009">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a009">To day from <unclear reason="illegible" cert="low" resp="#km">as</unclear></add></del> To thee <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a010">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a010">to day our</add> <del rend="overstrike">the</del> reaching arm, <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">the expectant eye,</del> <add place="above" seq="2">our <del rend="overstrike"><unclear reason="illegible" cert="low" resp="#km">p</unclear></del> turning neck,</add></subst>—<del rend="overstrike"><gap reason="illegible" extent="one character"/></del> to thee <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a011">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a011">from us,</add> the expectant eye,</l>
            
            <milestone unit="glued"/>
            
            <l>Thou cluster free<subst rend="overwrite"><del>&#8212;</del><add>!</add></subst> thou <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a012">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a012">brilliant</add> lustrous star!<subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">—learn</del> <del rend="overstrike" seq="3"><add place="above" seq="2">—first learning</add></del> <del rend="overstrike" seq="5"><add place="above" seq="4">will</add></del> <add place="above" seq="6">learning well,</add></subst> then, <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a013">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a013" rend="marked">for good</add></l>
            <l>The <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">last</del> <add place="above" seq="2">true</add></subst> lesson of a Nation's light in the sky</l>
            <l>(More shining than the Cross, more than the Crown,)</l>
            <l><subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">Summit</del> <add place="above" seq="2"><metamark function="add" target="#a014">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a014" seq="2">Its height</add></subst> of all <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a015">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a015"><subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">will</del> <add place="above" seq="2">to</add></subst> be</add> superb humanity.</l>
         </lg>
         
